{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/985860-warning-ponies-i-wrote-an-mlp-story-crossed-with-mage-the-awakening","id":985860,"title":"[Warning: Ponies] I Wrote an MLP Story Crossed with Mage: the Awakening....","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-11T18:45:31-07:00","id":985860,"title":"[Warning: Ponies] I Wrote an MLP Story Crossed with Mage: the Awakening....","content":"I was unsure I could get up the nerve to do this, but then I saw the &quot;Here be Ponies!&quot; thread. I am prepared for the possible raucous laughter to follow.<br /> <br /> I have been working on a story set within Equestria Girls (the human setting) crossed with Mage: the Awakening. I mostly use 2nd Edition, but did start last year after Friendship Games premiered, so at least some 1st Edition remains.<br /> <br /> The story revolves around Sunset Shimmer post-Awakening as she keeps her new identity a secret from her friends, while also learning all she can about being one of the Wise. Pinkie Pie is a Changeling, and Sweetie Belle is ... something. I basically threw Unseen Sense, Sleepwalker, and a few other random merits at her.<br /> <br /> If any other bronies here - or anyone else, really - wants to take a look, it is titled &quot;<a href=\"https://www.fimfiction.net/story/347562/the-tale-of-twin-souls\" target=\"_blank\">The Tale of Twin Souls</a>&quot; and is located at fimfiction.net.<br /> <br /> If anyone does decide to read it, I hope you find it entertaining.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12459-princeps","name":"princeps","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-